// expects: SGL4021
// A `@pin` under an engine that does not honour pins (DD-12 N6, H4): `elk`
// here, and `grid` in the pipeline harness, which lays every document out
// under grid. Neither declares the `pins` capability, so the pin is warned
// about at its key and ignored; the node is placed as if it had none.
@layout: { engine: elk }
a: { @label: "A", @pin: { x: 40, y: 40 } }
b: "B"
a -> b
